cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "multimodal-BD-Detection: a worked failure case in cross-corpus multimodal mental-health ML"
abstract: >-
  Diagnostic reanalysis of a multimodal bipolar-state classifier that reported 82.6% macro-F1
  and passed four standard validation checks while separating rows by source file. Documents
  three independent mechanisms, two hypotheses tested and rejected, and a corrected benchmark
  on the OBF-Psychiatric dataset.
type: software

